1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,977
The Sacred Groves: the gods are furious with the tourists, and they've made a pact

2
00:00:03,977 --> 00:00:04,695
with the Killer.

3
00:00:04,915 --> 00:00:06,664
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,432
Put the Divine Wrath card out with a tracking marker on level two, and line the

5
00:00:11,432 --> 00:00:14,369
Sacred Groves Bloodlust track up beside the Killer's board.

6
00:00:14,589 --> 00:00:18,992
Set the Finale token aside, and add both Atonement cards to the Action Tableau.

7
00:00:18,992 --> 00:00:20,776
They come in the Inkanyamba box.

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,165
Here you face the gods' fury as well as the Killer.

9
00:00:24,165 --> 00:00:27,232
It's tracked on the Divine Wrath card, from level one to ten.

10
00:00:27,452 --> 00:00:32,067
When told to Increase or Decrease Divine Wrath, move the marker up or down that many

11
00:00:32,067 --> 00:00:34,539
levels. It never goes below one or above ten:

12
00:00:34,539 --> 00:00:35,857
extra steps are ignored.

13
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:40,086
When told to Unleash Divine Wrath, look at the current level and apply whatever is

14
00:00:40,086 --> 00:00:40,771
printed there.

15
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,755
The higher the Wrath, the worse an Unleash gets.

16
00:00:43,975 --> 00:00:48,114
At low levels it does little. Further up it makes you discard random Action cards

17
00:00:48,114 --> 00:00:50,823
from your hand, and some levels raise Horror as well.

18
00:00:51,043 --> 00:00:55,399
At the top level, you discard every Action card except Atonement, then lower Divine

19
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:57,656
Wrath by the number of cards you discarded.

20
00:00:58,467 --> 00:01:03,066
The Burial Ground, the Sacred Shrine and the Holy Groves are Sacred spaces, marked

21
00:01:03,066 --> 00:01:03,459
in red.

22
00:01:03,679 --> 00:01:07,210
The more Victims standing on Sacred spaces, the angrier the gods.

23
00:01:07,210 --> 00:01:11,557
Many cards raise Divine Wrath by one for each Victim on a Sacred space, and some

24
00:01:11,557 --> 00:01:14,111
Terror cards add Victims there or pull them in.

25
00:01:14,331 --> 00:01:18,405
So getting Victims off those spaces, or saving them quickly, keeps the Wrath down.

26
00:01:19,233 --> 00:01:23,329
The Sacred Groves Bloodlust track lines up beside the Killer's own Bloodlust track.

27
00:01:23,549 --> 00:01:27,380
Whenever Bloodlust goes up, apply the Killer board's effects as normal, and also

28
00:01:27,380 --> 00:01:30,205
apply the matching line on the Groves track, if it has one.

29
00:01:30,425 --> 00:01:35,039
Those lines raise Divine Wrath by the number of Victims on Sacred spaces, or Unleash

30
00:01:35,039 --> 00:01:35,204
it.

31
00:01:36,033 --> 00:01:40,255
A few items and effects lower Divine Wrath, but your main tool is the Atonement

32
00:01:40,255 --> 00:01:44,477
Action card. It has an extra line for three or more successes on a Horror roll:

33
00:01:44,477 --> 00:01:46,615
the more successes, the bigger the drop.

34
00:01:46,835 --> 00:01:51,383
If the Finale is revealed, put the Sacred Groves Finale token on top of the Finale

35
00:01:51,383 --> 00:01:55,765
card. From then on, every Killer phase, after the Killer Action, Unleash Divine

36
00:01:55,765 --> 00:01:57,651
Wrath and then increase it by one.

37
00:01:58,467 --> 00:02:02,712
A few tips. Keep Victims off the Sacred spaces to stop Divine Wrath climbing.

38
00:02:02,932 --> 00:02:07,039
The Setup card matters here: there's a big win-rate gap between the easiest and

39
00:02:07,039 --> 00:02:07,455
hardest.

40
00:02:07,675 --> 00:02:10,216
Barbara's extra health helps you hit hard early.

41
00:02:10,216 --> 00:02:13,605
It's one of the hardest locations in logged games, so good luck.

